The Dimmer Switch SLC600-D is designed to control your device On/Off and adjust the brightness. You can bind it with multiple devices and control them at the same time.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0 compliant, works with any standard ZigBee hub
- Supports up to 2 dimmable devices to pair
- Controls multiple devices at the same time
- 86-type wire junction box installation
- Available in 3 colors
- 3-wire lighting systems
